            <ArticleTitle>[Stress-induced bundle-branch block].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1973-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present two patients with exercise-induced bundle branch block (BBB), in which coronary heart disease could not be diagnosed by noninvasive techniques. Exercise-induced BBB (right BBB more than left BBB) is strongly associated with and requires intensive search for coronary heart disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
